Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝才是最后一道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith was the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我杀了她就等于是我亲手释放了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her, and I set Lucifer free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群二愣子才是推动审判之日到来的幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sons of bitches jump-started judgment day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.17,0:00:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启已经降世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Apocalypse now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝吗 他早死了 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}God? he's dead, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.92,0:00:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,非你莫属啊 萨姆 你才是我真正的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one, Sam. you're my true vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是绝不可能的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是米迦勒之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the Michael sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 米迦勒之剑啥意思 - 你是米迦勒的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean, I'm the sword? - You're Michael's weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是具皮囊 - 独一无二的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a vessel? - You're the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.79,0:00:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对付的是恶作剧的精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a trickster on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那究竟是个啥玩意儿 幽灵还是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is it … spirit, demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切而言算是个半神\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like demigod.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.19,0:00:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们长生不老\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.29,0:00:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以制造出无中生有的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they can create things out of thin air,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常还会带点儿黑色幽默 来点儿致命的恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually with a sense of humor … deadly pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,得 鲍比忽略了一个细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, another thing Bobby mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙绝对是个十足的甜食爱好者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that these suckers have a real sweet tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你而言这很有趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is fun for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不同方式一次次地杀死迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Dean over and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这不过是给你上一课罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, there's a lesson here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上什么课 - 提醒你 迪恩是你的软肋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What lesson? - Dean's your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的敌人也都知道这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad guys know it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他迟早会为你牺牲 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be the death of you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:03.89,Title,0,0,0,0,,《凶鬼恶灵》是直接在观众面前表演的情景剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" is filmed before a live studio audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我需要张再大点儿的嘴才行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need a bigger mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 萨姆 怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there, Sam. what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是世界末日而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… just the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要张再大点儿的嘴才行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need a bigger mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.35,0:01:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你负责研究的那块搞定了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh…have you done your research yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.66,0:01:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的研究都搞定了 做了一宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All kinds of research. all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们似乎还有很多研究要完成噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we have some more "research" to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:06.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（惠灵顿 俄亥俄州）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:08.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（两天前）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个医务剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hospital show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:41.49,Title,0,0,0,0,,《性感医生》我觉得应该改拍自一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dr. Sexy, M.D." I think it's based on a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然你也看这种剧 更年期到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you hit menopause?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.43,0:03:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是无意间转到就顺便看看罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called channel-surfing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再确认一次 是什么风把联邦调查局吹来了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time … the F.B.I is here why, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我们是来调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it might have something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:04:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的一个当地居民的断头事件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With one of your locals getting his head ripped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔·伦道夫是因熊的袭击而毙命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill Randolph died from a bear attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有多肯定那一定是熊造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sure are you that it was a bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则还能是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西都追着伦道夫先生穿过了森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}It chased Mr. Randolph through the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,并撞开了他的前门 跟着他上了二楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smashed through his front door, followed him up the stairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后将他杀死在卧室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And killed him in his bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都合乎常理吗 一只熊能办到这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that common … a bear doing all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.27,0:04:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这取决于它是否被彻底激怒了那熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends how pissed off it is, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伦道夫一家住在森林的腹地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the Randolphs lived way up in high country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去的地方能足以吓哭一个成年男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got trout runs that'll make a grown man weep…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里还有熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.84,0:04:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 现在伦道夫太太怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. now, what about Mrs. Randolph?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.54,0:04:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案里说她目睹了这个事件的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The file says she saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错 我非常地同情那位可怜的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she did. my heart goes out to that poor woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她说的熊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西·伦道夫刚刚才经历丧夫之疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathy Randolph went through a hell of a trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚有点儿神智不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.73,0:04:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到底说了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那绝对是只熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. i-it must have been a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则 还能是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, what else could it have been?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦道夫太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Randolph…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you think it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我到现在都很清晰地记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I-I remember clearly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那的的确确是一只熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was definitely a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sure it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我们需要多收集线索 从各个角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}But see, it … it helps us to hear, uh, every angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不妨大方地说说你的所见和所想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, just tell us what you thought you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 虽然这不大可能 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's impossible, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以发誓我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I could have sworn I saw…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…The incredible hulk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The incredible hulk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早说过了 这很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. it's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是巴纳还是诺顿（两部电影的男主角名字）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bana or Norton?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 电影里的那种太恐怖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. those movies were terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是电视剧版的绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tv hulk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢·费雷格诺吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lou Ferrigno?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 满头小罗发型的那个卢·费雷格诺 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spiky-hair Lou Ferrigno? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你们一定以为我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我 只不过是 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-it's just … is …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有什么原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would there be any reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以致于那个卢·费雷格诺 绿巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Lou Ferrigno, the incredible hulk,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你丈夫有结怨呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, would have a grudge against your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:20.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（惠灵顿卫报 当地人遭遇熊攻击毙命）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲自去看了下案发的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, I saw the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.61,0:06:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有一个巨大的8英尺宽的洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is a giant 8-foot-wide hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在前门上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the front door used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像是 - 绿巨人挖的洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Almost like… - A hulk-sized hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 你又找到了什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我发现比尔·伦道夫脾气相当的坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it turns out that Bill Randolph had quite the temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾有两次因婚姻暴力入罪 还多次在酒吧闹事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he's got two counts of spousal battery, bar brawls,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,并被法院强制进行情绪管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And court-ordered anger-management sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说他一生气来就完全不是他本人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might say you wouldn't like him when he's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 现实中一个暴躁之人被电视剧中最暴躁的角色杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a hothead getting killed by tv's greatest hothead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来似乎罪有应得 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of sounds like just deserts, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就有点儿头绪来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all starting to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么头绪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it starting to make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在犯罪现场我还发现了别的一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I found something else at the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.05,0:07:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一堆糖纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Candy wrappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是很大一堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪有应得 爱吃甜食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just deserts, sweet tooth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在杀人前会先吓死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screwing with people before you kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恶作剧精灵 对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with the trickster, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,八九不离十了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.21,0:07:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是迫不及待地想手刃了这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been wanting to gank that mother since mystery spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你确定要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, are you sure you want to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个贱人当时对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch didn't think twice about icing me …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,千刀万剐的时候可没犹豫 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand times. - No, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是确认一下 - 那你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I…I mean, i'm just saying. - What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不想杀了他 还是怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't want to kill him, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和他谈谈 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talk to him. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 仔细想想 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, think about it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们见过的最强大的生物之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of the most powerful creatures we've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们能利用他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can use him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶作剧精灵是个享乐主义者 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Trickster's like a … like a hugh hefner type, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,莺歌艳舞 美女美酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine, women, song.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他不想让世界毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he doesn't want the party to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他和我们一样 都讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe he hates this "angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的天使恶魔大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}and demons" stuff as much as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他会帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he'll help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 此话当真 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're serious? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,与恶作剧精灵联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ally with the trickster?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个血腥暴力的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bloody, violent monster…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想和他成为朋友 欢乐地聊天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to be facebook friends with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,亏你想得出来 萨米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界濒临毁灭 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is gonna end, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没工夫纠结道德立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have the luxury of a moral stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说 这值得一试 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, it's worth a shot. that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不管用 我们再杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it doesn't work… we'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我们怎么找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we gonna find the guy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会只干一件就罢休 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he never takes just one victim, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会现身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫总台 6号公路 187号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, dispatch? I got a possible 187.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧造纸厂这儿有可疑情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out here at the old paper mill on route 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 沃尔特 我实在不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, Walt, I wouldn't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.35,0:09:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎样形容过才合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to begin to describe what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管派人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, um, send everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静 待在车旁 后援就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stay calm, stay by your car, our's on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定是那家伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird enough to be our guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿出了命案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a murder here…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,却连警车和警察都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no police cars … there's nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that look to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「医生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Doctor"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正经点 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,正经点吗 知道吗 你是才华横溢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, you're brilliant, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,却是个才华横溢的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a coward. you're a brilliant coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装蒜\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是皮科洛大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Dr. Piccolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.89,0:10:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦·皮科洛大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Ellen Piccolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.06,0:10:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真又性感的医生 她在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sexy-yet-earnest doctor at…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,西雅图慈善医院工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Seattle Mercy Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.17,0:10:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫装和性感实习生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor getups. the … the … the sexy interns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有「严肃认真」那一套 这说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The "seriouslys." it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.85,0:10:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,通什么鬼 到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes sense? what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:10:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在「性感医生」电视剧里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in "Dr. Sexy, M.D."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥们儿 搞什么鬼 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude, what the hell? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正经地说 到底搞什么鬼 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, seriously. what the hell? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便说点什么也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}One theory. any theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶作剧精灵把我们困在电视世界里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the trickster trapped us in TV land.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样认为就蠢到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your theory? that's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.81,0:11:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们在「性感医生」电视剧里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who said we're on "Dr. Sexy, M.D."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但才没有电视世界这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but TV land isn't TV land.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指电视节目得有演员 灯光和剧组人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there's actors a-and lights and crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道吗 可这是真实的 - 不可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know? this looks real. - It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 这怎么可能是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, how can this possibly be real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是王大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but there goes Dr. Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,性感而傲慢的外科大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sexy-but-arrogant heart surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是强尼·德莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's Johnny Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是活人 而是存在于他人脑海中的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's not even alive. he's a ghost in the mind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她 那位性感而神经质的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of her, the sexy-but-neurotic doctor over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个剧里为啥还有鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this show has ghosts? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不清楚 不过这种设定更刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It is compelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说过你不是粉丝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you aren't a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是粉丝 真的不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是他 - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's him. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他 是性感医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him. it's dr. sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能给我一个合适的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to give me one good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.95,0:12:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你违抗我的直接命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you defied my direct order.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,反对为比尔太太做试验性面部移植手术呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do the experimental face transplant on Mrs. Beale?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个理由吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是性感医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Dr. Sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:12:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我确定 性感医生的性感之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I swore part of what makes dr. sexy sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在于他穿的是牛仔靴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the fact that he wears cowboys boots…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是什么网球鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tennis shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说你不是粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're not a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫幸灾乐祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a guilty pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫保安来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call security.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.95,0:13:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你 伙计 但我们知道你的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, go ahead, pal. see, we know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个越发厉害了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把我们弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们拿的木桩呢 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't see your wooden stakes, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你通过警方无线电说话吧 那是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you on the police scanner, right? this is a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello-o-o?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是恶作剧精灵啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trickster?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样嘛 听说你们两爷们到了镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! I heard you two yahoos were in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就忍不住想找点乐子 - 我们到底在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could I resist? - Where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢吗 绝对独家制作哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like it? it's all homemade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,专用布景 专用演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own sets, my own actors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫它小小专用电视机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it my own little idiot box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:14:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 这可真是个难题（美国流行问答节目）\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my friend, is the $64 question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我们只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. we just …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈 我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk to you. we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩蠢蛋把世界搞得一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two muttonheads broke the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在指望我来收拾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want me to sweep up your mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就五分钟 请听我们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just five minutes. hear us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你猜怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,先活过这24小时 我们再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survive the 24 next hours, we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.15,0:14:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,活过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survive what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What game?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们身在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we play?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们正在玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're playing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,性感医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Sexy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,性感医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Sexy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫性感医生 请到急诊室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paging Dr. Sexy. Report to the E.R.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.09,0:14:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 跟怪物谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way … talking with monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 我们现在怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我要做什么吗 走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I'm doing? Leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady… What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个出色的 出色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a brilliant, brilliant…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,懦夫 你已经说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a coward. You already said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有事情要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got news for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我见过的所有脑神经外科医生中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the finest cerebrovascular neurosurgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,最出色的的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have ever met… And I have met plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.25,0:15:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那姑娘死在你手术台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that girl died on your table.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你的错 不是任何人的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault. It wasn't anybody's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,人总是会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes people just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're saying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕再做手术 害怕再去爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid to operate again, and you're afraid to love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子需要做面部移植手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife needs that face transplant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.85,0:16:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 知道吗 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You know what, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都不是真的 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is real, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子什么鬼东西也不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your wife doesn't need jack squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real! It's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里需要医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! we need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压80到50 正在下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}B.P. is 80 over 50… and dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:16:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 做点儿什么 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, do something. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这堆东西我都不会用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to use any of this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,学着用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 快点儿 我等着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Come on. I'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, I need a…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,折刀 一些牙线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penknife, some dental floss,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一根针 还有750毫升威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sewing needle, and a fifth of whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了 好了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We okay? How's it looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来玩 「砸蛋大冒险」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play "nut-cracker"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背弃亲哥哥选择的那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the name of the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的名字是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose over your own brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我该说什么 - 我怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What am I supposed to say? - You think I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我听不懂 日语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I-I don't … I don't understand, uh, Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背弃亲哥哥选择的那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the name of the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的名字是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose over your own brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是在耍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he screwing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:19:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我我我 我不会讲日语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I-I-I can't speak Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确答案是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 为什么抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry? Sorry for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.91,0:19:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,「砸蛋大冒险」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! "nut-cracker"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「砸蛋大冒险」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! "nut-cracker"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,千里先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Chikato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hai?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有介绍过这种营养虾片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we discussed these nutritious Shrimp Chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,营养丰富 味道好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of nutrition, tastes great…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且越吃越苗条 像你一样呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the more on eats, the slimmer they get just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.91,0:19:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎购买\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please buy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.19,0:20:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是恶作剧的一部分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this another trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 你们在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. Uh, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 你在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找你们 你们杳无音信好多天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for you. You've been missing for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就带我们离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us the hell out of here, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶作剧精灵先生不喜欢漂亮男天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Trickster does not like pretty-boy angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你弟弟从没出生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would your Mother and Father sitll be alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.63,0:20:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母是不是可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your brother was never born?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么办 我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I do? What do I do? I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.67,0:20:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想被敲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to get hit in the nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I know. Uh, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就 等一下 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just, um… Wait. - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我扮演的是医生 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I played a doctor. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「性感医生」里 我扮演的是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}In… in "Dr. Sexy." I played a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你做了手术 - 那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I operated. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我演了恶作剧精灵让我演的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I played the role the Trickster wanted me to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.12,0:21:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们应该继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-maybe we just have to go along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续什么 - 继续游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go along with what? - With the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 这是个问答节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're on a game show, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就回答问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, just answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用日语吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In Japanese? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不懂日语 - 试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know Japanese! - Try!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.86,0:21:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特 「砸蛋大冒险」冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester … "nut-cracker" champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.29,0:21:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,演好自己的角色 就能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We play our roles, we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 要演多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Play our roles for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我患了生殖器疱疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got genital herpes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.46,0:22:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我患了生殖器疱疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got genital herpes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你说演好自己角色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you're the one who said play our roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我患了生殖器疱疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got genital herpes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着负起责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to be responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.97,0:22:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我每天服用两次「疱疹清」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I take twice-daily Herpexia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.08,0:22:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以减小传染给他人的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}To reduce my chances of passing it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你的医生咨询如何服用「疱疹清」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask your doctor about using Herpexia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.93,0:22:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在服用「疱疹清」前 一定要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patients should always consult with a physician.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.68,0:22:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,咨询医嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before using Herpexia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.01,0:22:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能的副作用包括\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible side effects include.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.85,0:22:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,头痛 腹泻 永久性勃起功能障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headache, diarrhea, permanent erectile dysfunction,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.34,0:22:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心还有自杀的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thoughts of suicide, and nausea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.33,0:22:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一切我能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am doing all I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.07,0:23:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,略微减轻生殖器疱疹的传播\N{\fnArial\fs30}To slightly lessen the spread of genital herpes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.94,0:23:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.70,0:23:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am really, really very sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.27,0:23:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.99,0:23:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有些事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we've got some work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.75,0:23:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们也有事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we did do work…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,更深入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.09,0:23:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要做这个做多久啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do we have to keep doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.74,0:23:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.09,0:23:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许一辈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.43,0:23:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大概会死在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might die in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.43,0:24:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.67,0:24:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这群贪婪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.68,0:24:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.63,0:24:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有太多的时间 - 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have much time. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.51,0:24:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我离开了 - 从哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got out. - From where?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.78,0:24:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 有些事不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. something is not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.75,0:24:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西比它本来强大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing is much more powerful than it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.71,0:24:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西 那个恶作剧精灵吗 - 如果他是个恶作剧精灵的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What thing … the trickster? if it is a trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.62,0:24:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.42,0:24:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.92,0:24:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.86,0:24:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.69,0:24:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,停停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.93,0:24:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.57,0:24:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认识他啊 - 你刚才把他送哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know him? - Where did you just send him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.77,0:24:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 他会活着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. he'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.24,0:24:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.57,0:24:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我当猴耍 对吧 我们了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done with the monkey dance, okay? we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.75,0:24:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解什么了 神童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? get what, hotshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.58,0:24:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们扮演的角色 对吧 那是你的游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing our roles, right? that's your game?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.38,0:24:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那一半是游戏 - 那另一半是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's half the game. - What's the other half?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.09,0:24:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,向那边扮演你们的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play your roles out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.09,0:24:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.62,0:25:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 萨姆 扮演路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know … sam, starring as lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.73,0:25:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 扮演米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, starring as michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.26,0:25:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两人死斗 扮演你们的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your celebrity deathmatch. play your roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.40,0:25:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我们答应那些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to say yes to those sons of bitches?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.80,0:25:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 让我们点亮生命的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hells, yeah. let's light this candle!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.57,0:25:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那么做 这个世界就要完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do that, the world will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.74,0:25:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那是谁的过失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? and whose fault is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.61,0:25:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁释放了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who popped lucifer out of the box, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.55,0:25:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这才开始 你让它开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's started. you started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.29,0:25:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不可能停下来的 所以让我们做完它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be stopped. so, let's get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.66,0:25:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂还是地狱 你站哪边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven or hell … which side you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.46,0:25:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在任何一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not on either side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.46,0:25:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.70,0:25:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是选择跟米迦勒还是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're grabbing ankle for michael or lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.17,0:25:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.97,0:25:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我听好 你这个自大狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me, you arrogant dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.87,0:25:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不为任何一个混蛋做事 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work for either of those s.o.b.s, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.71,0:25:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是某人的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. oh, you're somebody's bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.55,0:26:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要以为你已经知道我是什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever, ever presume to know what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在仔细听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen very closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.00,0:26:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里将要发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.86,0:26:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要适应 承担你们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna suck it up, accept your responsibilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.50,0:26:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮演好命运所选的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}And play the roles that destiny has chosen for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不同意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.28,0:26:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们将要待在这个电视里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'll stay here in tv land…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.25,0:26:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.02,0:26:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,300个频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}300 channels and, uh, nothing's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.21,0:26:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.24,0:26:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.51,0:27:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,问我想的什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.25,0:27:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去你的 这就是我想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think go screw yourself, that's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.25,0:27:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我们点时间 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, can you give us a sec, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.22,0:27:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.99,0:27:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要冷静点儿 - 冷静吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got to calm down. - Calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.22,0:27:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晚上戴着墨镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am wearing sunglasses at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.02,0:27:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道谁干的 就是那个零智商的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who does that? no-talent douche bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.36,0:27:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.09,0:27:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌我们这个警察节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that we're in a procedural cop show.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.36,0:27:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.66,0:27:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我讨厌警匪片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I hate procedural cop shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.60,0:27:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将近有300个节目在电视里滚动播放\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's like 300 of them on television.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.11,0:27:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're all the??
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.30,0:27:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是像 看啊 那里一架飞机失事了 真蛋疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, "ooh, a plane crashed here." oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看那个甜食主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out sweet tooth over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.88,0:27:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think that's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.22,0:27:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.53,0:27:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.57,0:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.54,0:28:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.31,0:28:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了脖子有明显被勒的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aside from the ligature marks around his neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.98,0:28:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在其他地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}has what appears to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.68,0:28:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,咽喉下方有血块样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A roll of quarters jammed down his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.82,0:28:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I say…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.59,0:28:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他中彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.99,0:28:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.83,0:28:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在腹部有一处戳伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a stab wound to the lower abdomen there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.17,0:28:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I say…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.11,0:28:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不入虎穴，焉得虎子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no guts, no glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.35,0:28:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这人的胃给拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that guy a…Tums.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.59,0:28:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际保龄球？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gutter ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.16,0:28:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good one, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.29,0:29:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀错人了 蠢货们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the wrong guy, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.39,0:29:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried, man …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.89,0:30:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混蛋会对卡西下毒手\N{\fnArial\fs30}What that s.o.b. did to cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.19,0:30:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.38,0:30:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.62,0:30:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.15,0:30:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆 给我留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sam. leave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.91,0:30:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.95,0:30:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.32,0:30:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.21,0:30:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.69,0:30:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.56,0:30:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.19,0:30:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并没干掉恶作剧精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we killed the trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.38,0:30:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,木桩没起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stake didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.95,0:31:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么另一个木桩 - 我理解不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what? this another trick? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.62,0:31:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没起作用的原因是那个根本不是那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the stake didn't work because it's not a trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 你听卡西说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - I mean, you heard cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.63,0:31:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾说过这个家伙比恶作剧精灵更强力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said this thing was too powerful to be a trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.96,0:31:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他为什么老是盯着卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and did you notice the way he looked at cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.96,0:31:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该卡西了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost like he knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.17,0:31:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们说起米伽勒和路西法的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how pissed he got.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.60,0:31:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他有多愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you brought up michael and lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.30,0:31:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个混蛋 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son of a bitch. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.87,0:31:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道和我们对着干的家伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.32,0:31:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.92,0:31:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, um, feels really uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.88,0:31:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这能奏效\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.36,0:31:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 不过除了这我没法子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I have no other ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.38,0:31:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你这个混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.67,0:31:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.34,0:32:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.48,0:32:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该按喇叭么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I honk?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.78,0:32:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 瞧你多有轮廓美啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, get a load of the rims on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.65,0:32:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.02,0:32:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 准备好静静地离开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, boys, ready to go quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.66,0:32:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 别那么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.06,0:32:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在萨姆不能对人竖中指前 谁都不能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's going anywhere until Sam has opposable thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.73,0:32:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样有区别么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.00,0:32:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何撒旦也会骑在他屁屁上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satan's gonna ride his ass one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.28,0:32:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.05,0:32:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我一个问题 为什么木桩没杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me one thing. Why didn't the stake kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.39,0:32:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是恶作剧精灵啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the trickster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.29,0:32:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你根本不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.23,0:32:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你一直就是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you've always been an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.17,0:33:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.14,0:33:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 是不是有人给你们糖吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody slip a mickey in your power shake, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.78,0:33:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.34,0:33:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽管跳出这团圣火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just jump out of the holy fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.98,0:33:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们随后就赔礼道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll call it our mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.66,0:33:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,演得好 小伙子们 演得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played, boys. Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从哪弄来的圣油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get the holy oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.17,0:33:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说这是从萨姆屁股里抽出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you might say we pulled it out of Sam's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.80,0:33:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪里露馅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd I screw up?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.88,0:33:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.24,0:33:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但除了你 没别人能把卡西那样摆平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nobody gets the jump on Cass like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.18,0:33:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,按你们的说法这叫哈米吉多顿（世界末日善恶决战的战场）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly, it was the way you talked about armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.62,0:33:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,言下之意是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.68,0:33:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,以鄙人之见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, call it personal experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.99,0:33:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有被谈及他们的家族时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody gets that angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.45,0:33:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们才会如此愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless they're talking about their own family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.53,0:33:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你是哪个 性情暴躁的 爱打喷嚏的 还是那个唠叨的老婆娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, which one are you? grumpy, sneezy, or douchey?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.76,0:34:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是加百列 满意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.07,0:34:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们管我叫加百列\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call me Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.27,0:34:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列 大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel? the archangel?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.71,0:34:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,惭愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.31,0:34:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 加百列 大天使是怎么沦落成恶作剧精灵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Gabriel. How does an archangel become a trickster?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.95,0:34:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我申辩加保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own private witness protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.79,0:34:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带着会变脸的本领 从天堂坠落于凡间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I skipped out of heaven, had a face transplant,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.89,0:34:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开拓属于我的一个小世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carved out my own little corner of the world…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.99,0:34:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你们俩来毁了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till you two screwed it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.19,0:34:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天父知道你逃走 又转变信仰以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did daddy say when you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.50,0:34:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran off and join in the paynims?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.80,0:34:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天父持保留意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy doesn't say anything about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.97,0:34:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 为何你要弃他而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what happened? Why'd you ditch?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.14,0:34:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里怪他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you blame him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.64,0:34:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他的弟兄都是重量级的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, his brothers are heavyweight douche-nozzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.67,0:34:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your cake hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.97,0:34:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不了解我的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.53,0:34:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挚爱我父 我的弟兄们 曾经很爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved my father, my brothers … loved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.18,0:34:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看看他们对彼此的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But watching them turn on each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.38,0:34:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相厮杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tear at each other's throats?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.02,0:34:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直忍无可忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't bear it, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.26,0:34:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.16,0:35:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这一切正在重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's happening all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要协助我们阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then help us stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有去无回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.67,0:35:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想眼睁睁看着世界末日的到来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to see the end of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.73,0:35:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想结束一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it to be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.37,0:35:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜你们所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to sit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.90,0:35:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是要坐山观虎斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And watch my own brothers kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.61,0:35:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睁睁看着我的亲兄弟互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}each other, thach other，thanks you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.82,0:35:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使 地狱 我无所谓谁赢谁输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven, hell … I don't care who wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.51,0:35:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想一切尽早结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want it to be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.38,0:35:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情不一定会发展成那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it doesn't have to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.38,0:35:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定还有什么办法能挽救的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be some way to … to pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.82,0:35:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是一点都不了解我的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you do not know my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.21,0:35:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们所谓的天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you guys call the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.14,0:35:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我习惯叫他周日晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to call sunday dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.59,0:35:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,之所以不能阻止这一切的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why there's no stopping this …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.06,0:35:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为这关乎于一场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this isn't about a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.66,0:35:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,关乎于互相深爱的弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about two brothers that loved each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后反目成仇的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}And betrayed each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.87,0:35:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定认为 好像你们也被牵连进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you'd be able to relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.64,0:35:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.15,0:35:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真该道个歉 两个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sorry sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.15,0:36:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得为什么皮囊偏偏是你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think you two are the vessels?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.26,0:36:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.55,0:36:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,米迦勒 兄长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael … the big brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.22,0:36:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠实于那位并不在身边的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyal to an absent father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.46,0:36:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法 最小的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lucifer … the little brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.87,0:36:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是反抗父亲的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebellious of daddy's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.03,0:36:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们生来如此 小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were born to this, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.50,0:36:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.24,0:36:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,至始至终就是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.38,0:36:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿父的旨意行在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it is in heaven…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.81,0:36:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同行在天上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it must be on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.08,0:36:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟俩只能留一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One brother has to kill the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.98,0:36:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.59,0:36:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认为 为什么我会对你们这么感兴趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I've always taken such an interest in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在不久前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because from the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.06,0:36:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,天父在这里失去理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad flipped on the lights around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.90,0:36:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就知道你们将会来结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew it was all gonna end with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.60,0:36:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.98,0:36:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.15,0:37:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.51,0:37:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.85,0:37:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.03,0:37:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 这若真是一部电视剧就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I wish this were a tv show.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.86,0:37:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单的问答 鞠躬谢幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy answers, endings wrapped up in a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.64,0:37:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实摆在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.14,0:37:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将会用鲜血结束一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's gonna end bloody for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.81,0:37:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情毫无疑问会这样发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.99,0:37:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, boys…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.63,0:37:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.03,0:37:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用仅有的余生凝视彼此吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stare at each other for the rest of eternity?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.60,0:38:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.80,0:38:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得马上把卡西弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna bring Cass back from wherever you stashed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.21,0:38:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非做不可么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.41,0:38:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.88,0:38:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们把你泡在圣油里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we're going to dunk you in some holy oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.38,0:38:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后油炸大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And deep-fry ourselves an archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.22,0:38:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.46,0:38:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.33,0:38:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 加百列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.84,0:38:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.30,0:38:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻父之旅如何啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the search for daddy going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.77,0:38:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 糟糕透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. Awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.68,0:38:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.78,0:38:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.39,0:38:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.36,0:38:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey … guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.09,0:38:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So … so, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.93,0:39:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算把我禁锢在这儿一辈子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna … you're gonna leave me here forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.23,0:39:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.97,0:39:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟你不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we don't screw with people the way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.41,0:39:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我声明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the record…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.24,0:39:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝不是你们弟兄间的拳击赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about some prizefight between your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.15,0:39:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者某某命运我们不可逆转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or some destiny that can't be stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.28,0:39:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.69,0:39:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢抵抗你的家族而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being too afraid to stand up to your family!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.01,0:39:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说你没对我们做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say I never did anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.67,0:40:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他滔滔不绝讲的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that stuff he was spouting in there …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.07,0:40:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得可信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he was telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.14,0:40:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他是置信不疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he believes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.74,0:40:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.01,0:40:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.78,0:40:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.41,0:40:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会儿我还真希望我在演电视剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right about now, I wish I was back on a tv show.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.72,0:40:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
